                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "National Food Composition Databases (FCDBs) are the main and most widely available source of nutrient information for unpacked foods, such as fruits and vegetables. This dataset presents the nutrient content in fresh fruits and vegetables from FCDBs, both in the Euregio Meuse-Rhine and in the top eight European producers. Moreover, presents the absolute and practical differences on light of nutrition and health claims requirements under the European legislation."
                },
